hen making your purchase is the cost of the device itself.&nbsp;<br><br>In fact, many backup sticks, such as ThePhotoStick Omni, have a <b>FREE app</b> that you can download straight to your mobile device.&nbsp;</span></p><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-djWRfJ dtXvbo pf-53_ pf-sm-hide"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-BHvUt fJlZte pf-55_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Learn More</span></span></a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-56_"><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hYQoXb ctGkmz pf-57_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/reason-1-1653581798874.png?v=1653581801" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/reason-1-1653581798874.png?v=1653581801 1536w" width="2700" height="2700" alt="meet the founder"/></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-fceb" data-category="Brand Story" data-name="Leafy" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-igXgud lhtyiH pf-58_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-cjrPHo eOcrMz"><div class="sc-clIzBv iQyrr pf-59_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;--s-sm:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:5"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO pf-60_"><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hYQoXb ctGkmz pf-61_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/reason-2-1653584157372.gif?v=1653584166" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/reason-2-1653584157372.gif?v=1653584166 1536w" width="1080" height="1080" alt="meet the founder"/></a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:7"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gXRojI kCnmwO p